msgstr "Selecteer een leesbare game om de modus in te stellen."

#. Select is a button's name (unchanged).
#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Select is the touchpad button on PS5."
msgstr "Select is de touchpad-toets op de PS5."

#. Heading: the language highlighted in the list.
#: pe/ui/browse.cpp
msgid "SELECTED"
msgstr "GESELECTEERD"

#. Why a game did not start (the file is gone).
#: eden_services.cpp
msgid "Selected ROM is no longer available"
msgstr "De geselecteerde ROM is niet meer beschikbaar"

#: pe/ui/home.cpp, pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Instellingen"

#. Label: whether keys and firmware are in place.
#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "SETUP"
msgstr "CONFIGURATIE"

#: eden_services.cpp, host/fake_services.cpp
msgid "Setup required"
msgstr "Configuratie vereist"

#: eden_services.cpp, host/fake_services.cpp
msgid "Setup required: {0} Open Settings, Game files to choose the folder that holds your keys, firmware and roms folders (or add the files to {1}), then reopen ProsperoEden."
msgstr "Configuratie vereist: {0} Open Instellingen > Gamebestanden en kies de map waarin je mappen keys, firmware en roms staan (of zet de bestanden in {1}). Open ProsperoEden daarna opnieuw."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Setup status and detailed logs."
msgstr "Configuratiestatus en uitgebreide logs."

#: eden_services.cpp
msgid "Setup validation failed. Check that firmware and key files are readable and valid."
msgstr "Controle van de configuratie mislukt. Controleer of de firmware- en sleutelbestanden leesbaar en geldig zijn."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Shortcuts during a game, and vibration."
msgstr "Sneltoetsen tijdens een game en de trilfunctie."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Show or hide the FPS overlay"
msgstr "De FPS-teller tonen of verbergen"

#: pe/ui/library.cpp
msgid "SIZE"
msgstr "GROOTTE"

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Solid panels, brighter text and an outlined highlight."
msgstr "Ondoorzichtige panelen, helderdere tekst en een omlijnde markering."

#: settings_store.h
msgid "Spanish"
msgstr "Spaans"

#: settings_store.h
msgid "Spanish (Latin America)"
msgstr "Spaans (Latijns-Amerika)"

#. The app creates its user the first time a game runs.
#: eden_services.cpp
msgid "Start any game once before importing a save."
msgstr "Start eerst één keer een game voordat je opgeslagen data importeert."

#. Shown over a game's cover while it starts.
#: pe/ui/launcher.cpp
msgid "STARTING"
msgstr "WORDT GESTART"

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Stops the background drifting and the screens sliding, here and on the loading screen."
msgstr "De achtergrond staat stil en schermen schuiven niet meer, hier en op het laadscherm."

#: pe/ui/browse.cpp
msgid "Supply your own files"
msgstr "Gebruik je eigen bestanden"

#: eden_services.cpp
msgid "Taiwan"
msgstr "Taiwan"

#: settings_store.h
msgid "Thai"
msgstr "Thai"

#. Heading of the acknowledgements.
#: pe/ui/browse.cpp
msgid "THANKS"
msgstr "DANKWOORD"

#: pe/ui/browse.cpp
msgid "Thanks to the whole PS5 homebrew community and to every developer whose drivers, tools and libraries make ProsperoEden possible."
msgstr "Dank aan de hele PS5-homebrewcommunity en aan elke ontwikkelaar wiens drivers, tools en bibliotheken ProsperoEden mogelijk maken."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "The folder that holds your keys, firmware and games."
msgstr "De map met je sleutels, firmware en games."

#. Why a game stopped. 'Settings, Video' is the menu path; 'the game's own settings' is the Game settings dialog of the Library.
#: eden_services.cpp
msgid "The game ran out of graphics memory. Lower the resolution in Settings, Video (or in the game's own settings) and start it again."
msgstr "De game had geen grafisch geheugen meer. Verlaag de resolutie via Instellingen > Video (of in de game-instellingen) en start de game opnieuw."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "The language games use when they offer it."
msgstr "De taal die games gebruiken als ze die aanbieden."

#: pe/ui/browse.cpp
msgid "THIS FOLDER"
msgstr "DEZE MAP"

#: pe/ui/browse.cpp
msgid "This folder cannot be opened."
msgstr "Deze map kan niet worden geopend."

#: eden_services.cpp
msgid "This game has no save to export yet."
msgstr "Deze game heeft nog geen opgeslagen data om te exporteren."

#: pe/ui/library.cpp
msgid "This game's settings cannot be saved (no title ID)."
msgstr "Kan de instellingen van deze game niet opslaan (geen titel-ID)."

#. ryujinx/, save-import/ and roms/ are folder names (unchanged); {0} is the game's ID.
#: eden_services.cpp
msgid "To import, copy a Ryujinx folder to ryujinx/ or a save to save-import/{0}/, next to roms/."
msgstr "Kopieer om te importeren een Ryujinx-map naar ryujinx/ of opgeslagen data naar save-import/{0}/, naast roms/."

